message: "If you use this code or the confirmation package, please cite it as below. The dataset has its own record (see references)."
title: "EdgeSAR study code and fresh-confirmation package"
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24454853"
license: MIT
