    given-names: "Samadhi Viduravi"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4124-8002"
    affiliation: "Informatics Institute of Technology, Colombo (University of Westminster)"
abstract: "Code and pre-registered confirmation package for a study of moving a hidden-state task-record classifier from the FP16 to the 4-bit Q4_K_M version of Llama 3.2 1B Instruct, measured by missed incidents in a simulated multi-UAV flood rescue with a bounded CBBA allocator. All reports are synthetic."
keywords:
  - quantization
  - edge AI
  - multi-UAV task allocation
  - search and rescue
